                    {
                        "translation_id": "64bd0068-aa62-418f-b0a7-2c1e4f997237",
                        "source_entry_id": "7062ad06-5138-3e3a-90f2-d94cbbd347f5",
                        "source_sense_description": "беспорядочно перемешиваясь, смешиваясь",
                        "target_lang_word": "pell-mell",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pell-mell",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ea8988a-e9ea-395a-aaf0-cb96d8620d4f",
                                        "entry_id": "28f49590-b44d-3eb4-92ab-da487e700c47",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hasty and uncontrolled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa5ccafd-dc9c-432e-b348-f2a3208c7196",
                                                "sense_id": "4ea8988a-e9ea-395a-aaf0-cb96d8620d4f",
                                                "text": "Nor moody Beggars, ſtaruing for a time / Of pell-mell hauocke, and confusion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb32a09d-b861-4fd3-b1f9-0002e32c0629",
                                                "sense_id": "4ea8988a-e9ea-395a-aaf0-cb96d8620d4f",
                                                "text": "These present the appearance of masses of water-worn gravel, mixed in the most pell mell confusion, the boulders being often of very large size; but I observed no striae, nor any of the blue tenacious clay of the Till, which it so much resembled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6d917cd-ddbc-4631-bb91-201833595e3c",
                                                "sense_id": "4ea8988a-e9ea-395a-aaf0-cb96d8620d4f",
                                                "text": "The whole district presents the most pell-mell throwing together imaginable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "618a27b1-8e49-47d6-b9b9-320a66a411ec",
                                                "sense_id": "4ea8988a-e9ea-395a-aaf0-cb96d8620d4f",
                                                "text": "The pell mell, hell for leather traffic of Lagos was more pell mell, hell for leather than ever."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8498b44e-5248-47bd-9f6a-b372e97aebf1",
                                                "sense_id": "4ea8988a-e9ea-395a-aaf0-cb96d8620d4f",
                                                "text": "The cattle are less disciplined, more pell-mell, heavy-footed, their hooves stamping the ground to mud in several places."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adde5060-0f34-4167-b7b5-2b1b8c5a3b26",
                                                "sense_id": "4ea8988a-e9ea-395a-aaf0-cb96d8620d4f",
                                                "text": "China’s pell-mell, brisk urbanization has in some ways made the challenge harder to face."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pell-mell",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a1aef5f2-7443-3a3e-b6eb-53055009dae0",
                                        "entry_id": "b99dff10-a720-309f-b271-fe7904951f13",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In haste and chaos; uncontrolledly, confusedly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d88c7d8-8434-441e-97f1-a09864b6f046",
                                                "sense_id": "a1aef5f2-7443-3a3e-b6eb-53055009dae0",
                                                "text": "But ſeeing that there the murdring Enemie, / Peſle-meſle, purſued them like a ſtorme of hayle, / They gan retyre vvhere Iuba vvas encampt; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2479183a-4368-4bb9-a1f2-73cc48320c49",
                                                "sense_id": "a1aef5f2-7443-3a3e-b6eb-53055009dae0",
                                                "text": "Never was there a great battle fought more pell-mell, since war began; never was valor so completely thrown away."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8781eba-1dce-4f46-b681-e5e1723d7f93",
                                                "sense_id": "a1aef5f2-7443-3a3e-b6eb-53055009dae0",
                                                "text": "The table was covered with a confusion of papers, books, pamphlets, all heaped upon one another pell-mell; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4d93065-1623-48c9-91ff-6068de3176a6",
                                                "sense_id": "a1aef5f2-7443-3a3e-b6eb-53055009dae0",
                                                "text": "Pell-mell they rushed for Inverness and safety, leaving the strange battlefield to the stalwart five."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45651071-c347-4bce-ad40-5ac01c801761",
                                                "sense_id": "a1aef5f2-7443-3a3e-b6eb-53055009dae0",
                                                "text": "A group of the reapers whom we had seen running from the fields were lying all pell-mell, their bodies crossing each other, at the bottom of it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93dcdc67-d4d6-45ec-8818-4723037839e5",
                                                "sense_id": "a1aef5f2-7443-3a3e-b6eb-53055009dae0",
                                                "text": "And the prompter our payments the more pell-mell the news came in and the more obligingly gruesome its detail."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bcdaa3b-dab5-44a3-8e8f-d2facf1cb925",
                                                "sense_id": "a1aef5f2-7443-3a3e-b6eb-53055009dae0",
                                                "text": "Some are already packed up well; / Others are at it, most pell mell."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pell-mell",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d531ad2-dcaf-3be6-beb4-c293d4e6e583",
                                        "entry_id": "aaef0c3b-3d8e-3eb7-8ee3-efa6096cf0b5",
